---
title: "discord_oauth_callback (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_code: extract code from query params
    q_check_code --> q_error_no_code: code is null
    q_check_code --> q_exchange: code exists
    q_error_no_code --> q_redirect_login: redirect to /login with error
    q_redirect_login --> [*]
    q_exchange --> q_resolve_redirect: supabase.auth.exchangeCodeForSession(code)
    q_exchange --> q_exchange_fail: exchange fails
    q_exchange_fail --> q_redirect_login: redirect to /login with error
    q_resolve_redirect --> q_check_cookie: read oauth_redirect httpOnly cookie
    q_check_cookie --> q_use_cookie: cookie exists
    q_check_cookie --> q_check_query: cookie is null
    q_use_cookie --> q_sanitize: redirect_url = cookie value
    q_check_query --> q_check_client_cookie: query param redirect exists
    q_check_query --> q_default_redirect: no query param
    q_check_client_cookie --> q_sanitize: client cookie exists
    q_check_client_cookie --> q_default_redirect: no client cookie
    q_default_redirect --> q_sanitize: redirect_url = /dashboard
    q_sanitize --> q_build_url: extract path+query only (prevent open redirect)
    q_build_url --> q_set_cookies: construct absolute URL with origin
    q_set_cookies --> q_clear_oauth_cookie: attach Supabase session cookies
    q_clear_oauth_cookie --> [*]: clear oauth_redirect cookie and redirect

    note right of q_sanitize
        INV-001: redirect_url must be a relative path (no absolute URLs to external hosts)
        INV-002: only path and query components are preserved from user-supplied URLs
    end note

    note right of q_exchange
        INV-003: session exchange must complete before any redirect occurs
        INV-004: Supabase cookies must be set on the response for session persistence
    end note
